Financing Activities Cash Flows

Net cash used in financing activities was $360.0 million for the year ended December 31, 2025, compared to net cash provided by financing activities of $944.9 million for the year ended December 31, 2024, representing a decrease of $1.305 billion. The significant components of the decrease included the following:

